(ned RERACK TOOL -- machine-parks the spindle tool into its assigned home)
; operator 2026-08-04: "the only way to put tool 5 in rack with software is
; to store the tool: either m6g43 or Rerack Tool". Physical put-away via
; m21 with all its sensor gates; no fetch follows, so the exit climbs to
; full traverse Z.
o<rerack_tool> sub
#<t> = #5400
o1 if [#<t> LT 1]
    (abort, rerack: no tool is recorded in the spindle)
o1 endif
#<home> = #[4400 + #<t>]
#<pockets> = #<_ini[atc]pockets>
o2 if [[#<home> LT 1] OR [#<home> GT #<pockets>]]
    (abort, rerack: T%d#<t> has no assigned home fork - set its P in the tool table)
o2 endif
o3 if [#[4000 + #<home>] NE 0]
    (abort, rerack: the home fork record is not empty)
o3 endif
o<m21> call [#<home>] [0]
o<rerack_tool> endsub
M2
